1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,272
Just Some Fries.

2
00:00:02,421 --> 00:00:05,353
A game about one very hungry seagull.

3
00:00:05,854 --> 00:00:08,666
It begins with a fry that nobody notices.

4
00:00:13,454 --> 00:00:17,034
And a big brother who has everything... and is still hungry.

5
00:00:21,954 --> 00:00:26,710
Dive. Lock on. When the world slows down, find the rhythm.

6
00:00:26,859 --> 00:00:29,384
Every fry is a tiny rhythm game.

7
00:00:32,754 --> 00:00:36,118
Hold Tab, and the island shows you what it hides.

8
00:00:36,268 --> 00:00:39,655
Silver. Gold. Diamond. Rainbow.

9
00:00:40,156 --> 00:00:43,088
Coffee. A cocktail. Ice cream.

10
00:00:43,237 --> 00:00:47,130
Drink all three at once... and the gull can see the wind.

11
00:00:49,956 --> 00:00:53,344
In STARLIGHT, even falling stars can be caught.

12
00:00:56,956 --> 00:01:01,448
And when you catch one, the game stops to watch... while you keep flying.

13
00:01:09,956 --> 00:01:13,319
Catch a cloud. A rainbow. The sun itself.

14
00:01:13,469 --> 00:01:15,921
And somehow... you are still hungry.

15
00:01:22,956 --> 00:01:27,735
Out of breath over the sea? It will hold you. Rest, and take off again.

16
00:01:32,956 --> 00:01:36,631
But in the end... only one fry was ever the point.

17
00:02:06,256 --> 00:02:08,228
Just Some Fries.

18
00:02:08,377 --> 00:02:11,645
Play it in your browser, or download it for Windows.

